@startuml
title 适老化打车平台 - 语音叫车时序图 (Sequence Diagram)

actor "老年用户" as User
participant "APP前端\n(React Native)" as App
participant "语音服务\n(Voice Service)" as Voice
participant "后端API\n(Backend API)" as API
participant "司机端" as Driver

User -> App: 点击麦克风按钮
activate App
App -> Voice: 开始录音 (zh-CN)
activate Voice
User -> Voice: 说出目的地
Voice --> App: 返回识别文本
deactivate Voice
App -> App: 解析语音意图\n(parseVoiceIntent)
App --> User: 显示确认弹窗\n(大字模式)
deactivate App

User -> App: 点击"确认叫车"
activate App
App -> API: POST /ride/createOrder\n{destination, userId}
activate API
API -> API: 创建订单
API -> Driver: 推送订单通知
activate Driver
Driver --> API: 司机接单
deactivate Driver
API --> App: 返回司机信息\n{name, carModel, plateNumber, eta}
deactivate API
App -> Voice: TTS播报\n"已为您匹配司机..."
activate Voice
Voice --> User: 语音播报
deactivate Voice
App --> User: 显示司机信息\n(大字车牌号)
deactivate App

== 等待接驾 ==

Driver -> API: 更新位置/状态
API --> App: 实时推送状态
App -> Voice: TTS播报状态变化
Voice --> User: "司机即将到达"

== 行程结束 ==

Driver -> API: 结束行程
API --> App: 推送账单信息
App --> User: 显示支付界面
@enduml
